  offerLine: Don't say anything. Is that letter sealed? Did anyone see you? Bring it here, and keep your voice down.
  activeLine: Hand it over. Quietly.
  readyLine: It's in code. I can't read it, I didn't write it. But the seal's a little bat. Take it to Pekapeka, and you never saw me.
  doneLine: Who are you? I've never met you.
